Z||000011||Oreif||05-22-2000||02:00 AM||||OK, OK, I have the Sprint Manifolds. They have been on for 3 years now and the clear coating (not sure what the coating is exactly) they put on is still intact. There is no discoloration and appears the coating does not scratch easily. They look as good as the day I installed them. I won't get into the Horsepower/cost/effectiveness of the manifolds. I'll just say I bought mine when they first came out for $437.00, I bought them because they were less restrictive then stock, they looked nice, No changes to the rest of the exhaust system, I didn't know of any other manifolds or headers in 1997, and my stock manifolds were cracked.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 05-22-2000).]||||reg||2
